s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-28T02:09:50Z","updated_at":"2025-05-28T02:09:50Z","body":"> @clayjohn I believe this is done now unless you can think of anything I could be missing\r\n\r\nI should have caught this earlier (Calinou's comment made me realize), but this same change should be added for the Compatibility renderer too. The code is very similar to the mobile and forward+ renderers, so the implementation can basically be copied over. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2914666896/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2917292318","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106593#issuecomment-2917292318","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106593","id":2917292318,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6t4lke","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-28T18:46:44Z","updated_at":"2025-05-28T18:46:44Z","body":"I brought this up in today's rendering meeting and the team expressed a bit of concern about adding yet another tool to manage rendering order in the transparent pipeline. Right now we have render priority, sort offset and aabb center. We want to avoid a situation where there are multiple competing solutions to the same problem. We ran out of time before we could fully discuss the problem and whether `sorting_stacked_order` is the proper solution we want to go forward with. \r\n\r\nUnfortunately since this PR didn't link any of the related proposals, we didn't have those in front of us to properly judge whether the current tools available are enough for users. \r\n\r\nI think we will need to discuss this again at the meeting in two weeks with the proposals in hand to properly decide what to do. Personally I am leaning towards merging the implementation in this form (once Compatibility renderer support is added), but I want to make sure everyone is happy with that approach. \r\n\r\nFor future reference, here are the proposals that relate to this:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12214\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/3971 (proposal is for 2D, but discussion includes 3D)\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/3986","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2917292318/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2922015986","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106593#issuecomment-2922015986","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106593","id":2922015986,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uKmzy","user":{"login":"Faolan-Rad","id":46481567,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NDgxNTY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46481567?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad","html_url":"https://github.com/Faolan-Rad","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-30T10:53:42Z","updated_at":"2025-05-30T10:53:42Z","body":"I did add a MSVC warning ignore in cowdata because after rebase I was no longer able to compile locally because of it. I did update MSVC so I don't know if it was a problem was with a recent commit or a new thing with the newer version of MSVC \r\nI added the warning suppression in cowdata stating it is a false positive mod by 0","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2922015986/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2922072376","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106593#issuecomment-2922072376","issu