0","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106593","id":2981900460,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6xvDCs","user":{"login":"Faolan-Rad","id":46481567,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NDgxNTY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46481567?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad","html_url":"https://github.com/Faolan-Rad","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-17T21:32:17Z","updated_at":"2025-06-17T21:32:17Z","body":"@clayjohn I added compatible render I believe at this point the pr is completely ready ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2981900460/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2997626447","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106593#issuecomment-2997626447","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106593","id":2997626447,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yrCZP","user":{"login":"Lielay9","id":40064911,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMDY0OTEx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40064911?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9","html_url":"https://github.com/Lielay9","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lielay9/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-23T18:57:24Z","updated_at":"2025-06-23T18:57:24Z","body":"FYI there's a merge conflict.\r\n\r\nMade another project for specifically testing the order of meshes on the same plane. Once again, coming from the perspective of 2.5D, the predictable and tunable order this pr brings is a great improvement. I have forked and used this pr now for a couple weeks and the implementation seems solid.\r\n\r\n[alpha-sort-demo.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20870692/alpha-sort-demo.zip):\r\n\r\n<img width=\"828\" alt=\"stable_sort_order_demo\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5443bab4-e5fc-467b-9e3f-682253bc6c9f\" />\r\n\r\nAll colored squares are on the same plane. Disregard the left side, the sorting in pr does work correctly; for the left and 2.5D games at large to work you'd also need the option for depth be calculated using custom plane/normal.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2997626447/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2997993874","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106593#issuecomment-2997993874","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106593","id":2997993874,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yscGS","user":{"login":"Faolan-Rad","id":46481567,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NDgxNTY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46481567?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad","html_url":"https://github.com/Faolan-Rad","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-23T21:24:57Z","updated_at":"2025-06-23T21:31:21Z","body":"\n> \n> All colored squares are on the same plane. Disregard the left side, the sorting in pr does work correctly; for the left and 2.5D games at large to work you'd also need the option for depth be calculated using custom plane/normal.\n\nI think the thing that would make it easier is transparency groups where you put all of the objects in a group which makes them all the same depth and with that you set it to use the closest object depth farthest mid point or average. So in your use case each layer/plane you want you put them all in a group\n\nI do think a definable pipeline for depth to override how it works on a per object basis would be nice which could even be the system used to make the transparency groups ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2997993874/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3018316577","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106593#issuecomment-3018316577","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106593","id":3018316577,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6z59sh","user":{"login":"Faolan-Rad","id":46481567,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NDgxNTY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46481567?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad","html_url":"https://github.com/Faolan-Rad","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Faolan-Rad/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-30T08:47:52Z","updated_at":"2025-06-30T08:47:52Z","body":"Should I just already add the system for transparency groups which would make the use of stacked sorting order. I would add the nearest, farthest, average which is the distance chosen for the group of transparent objects ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3018316577/reactions"